  - parameter: Tbg 11.5, 27.4, 33.9, 43.1 K for Band 4, Band 6, Band 7 1.1 mm, 0.87 mm [3.1 Line Identification: "$T_\mathrm{bg}$ is estimated to be $11.5~\mathrm{K}$, $27.4~\mathrm{K}$, $33.9~\mathrm{K}$ and $43.1~\mathrm{K}$"]
  - assumption: Negligible beam dilution; thermalized transitions since n_H2 >> n_crit (~1e5 cm-3) [3.1 Line Identification: "As $n_\text{\ce{H2}} \gg n_\mathrm{crit}$, it is reasonable to assume that these transitions are thermalized toward MM1."]
  - validation: Six vt=1 and three vt=2 clean features identified using P and D factors [3.1 Line Identification: "We identify a total of six $v_\mathrm{t} = 1$ features and three $v_\mathrm{t} = 2$ features"]
